    "en": {
      "trackName": "1-2 Player Cowboy Duel",
      "description": "A fun retro game in a western setting for up to two players on phone and watch! Play offline wherever you want.\n\nFeatures:\n- One player and 2 player mode for watch, tablet and phone!\n- Authentic western feeling\n- Cute retro pixel art\n- Play offline\n- More games you can unlock inside\n\nMore info:\nYou're a cowboy and you have been challenged to a duel! For what reason? Who knows... Anyway, your goal is to hit the other cowboy (not the cows!). After every six shots you need to reload.\nFor every time you hit the other cowboy, you get 10 points, if you hit the wall you get one point, still. Each cowboy has three lives. But enough now, it's time to face your rival!",
